<Slide style={{ background: '#0B1020', padding: 60 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>⑦ 合起来用：连订阅来的正文也能被搜到</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>09 / 功能 6 × 功能 5</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.4)', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginTop: 20 }}>
        <Image src="assets/search-ask-real.png" style={{ width: 620, height: 300, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155' }} />
        <Image src="assets/feed-article.jpg" style={{ width: 524, height: 300, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155' }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 13, marginTop: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 278, padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>60 / 75</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>条订阅内容有完整正文</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 278, padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>8.3 万字</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>共入库正文，平均每条 1,447 字</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 278, padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #4F46E5' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>RSS 源：零额外请求</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>feed 自带全文字段，直接取 —— 不额外打扰源站</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 278, padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #4F46E5' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>网页源：限速抓详情</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>每域名间隔 1.5 秒，62 条约 2 分钟抓完</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, padding: 16, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #F0ABFC' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>方便在哪</span>
            ：这是它最不一样的地方 —— 搜"体检"命中的不是标题里有"体检"的那条，而是某条通知正文里写的体检安排；问"选课通知说了什么"，答案直接引了正文里的日期和流程，点 [1] 就能看到原文。左图就是真实 Key 下的一次问答：1 条直接命中 + 3 条引用。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 670 }}>个人工作台 · v0.2.0</Text>
</Slide>
